{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22212","headline":"闻早莺 · 白居易","name":"闻早莺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日出眠未起，屋头闻早莺。\n忽如上林晓，万年枝上鸣。\n忆爲近臣时，秉笔直承明。\n春深视草暇，旦暮闻此声。\n今闻在何处，寂莫浔阳城。\n鸟声信如一，分别在人情。\n不作天涯意，岂殊禁中听。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22212.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22212","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}